{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We can't save the world alone, the OSA needs you soldier - enlist NOW by <strong>wishlisting</strong> Zero Caliber 2!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">### <strong>THE SEQUEL</strong> ###</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your favorite all-in-one VR FPS made infinitely better! Get ready to experience the thrill of virtual battlefields in Zero Caliber 2, the sequel to our critically acclaimed Zero Caliber military shooter!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719740/extras/ZC2_SteamDesc.png?t=1744623749\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We took everything we learned during Zero Caliber's develoment, mixed it with our community's feedback and suggestions - the result will be mind blowingly awesome! Cinematic action, explosions, tons of weapons to unlock, a full-blown single player/Co-op campaign (taking place after the events of the prequel), PvP, airstrikes and more explosions. A VR experience you'll never forget!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coming to your VR gear in Q2 2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">### <strong>COMMUNITY</strong> ###</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To catch sneak peeks and behind the scenes stuff, join our awesome community on Discord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719740/extras/ZC2_SteamDiscord.png?t=1744623749\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2719740?t=1744623749","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719740/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744623749","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719740/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744623749","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstati